          teachingResources: `Samples of questionnaires, interview guides, observation guides, etc.; Computer application software such as Excel, MS Word, Wordpad, etc.; Mathematical sets; Technology tools such as computers, mobile phones, etc; Mathematical sets. colour pens, etc.; Technology tools such as computers, mobile phones, Reports from analysed data; etc. Worksheets; Computer software applications like GeoGebra Posters; Graph sheets teaching presentations; sets. colour pens, etc.; Technology tools such as computers, mobile phones, etc. Reports from analysed data; Computer software applications like GeoGebra Worksheets; Graph sheets Posters; computer with data organising software like MS Excel, MS teaching presentations; PowerPoint, etc., enquiry project-template; manila cards A4, A3 papers; flip charts; markers`
